cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this reproducibility package, please cite the archived release and the associated paper."
type: software
title: "Classical versus Hybrid Post-Quantum TLS 1.3: Reproducibility Package"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-14
abstract: >-
  Data, archived TLS and Nginx configurations, hardware records, measurement
  logs, and analysis utilities supporting an experimental comparison of
  classical X25519 and hybrid X25519MLKEM768 in TLS 1.3 across three x86
  servers, multiple concurrency levels, and controlled network conditions.
